Write a function clamp_sum that takes two unsigned 32-bit numbers a and b and returns their sum limited to the range 10 to 100: a sum below 10 gives 10, a sum above 100 gives 100, any other sum is returned as it is. Write and use a helper function clamp(x, lo, hi) that limits an unsigned 32-bit number x to the range lo..hi. Unsigned 32-bit arithmetic wraps around modulo 2^32 (it never traps).
